PARAMETER HYDROGEN_DH2(YYY,CCCRRRAAA) 'Yearly demand for hydrogen at a Regional level (MWh of H2)';
* EHB (European Hydrogen Backbone) demand for fertilizer and steel; industrial heat, fuel and HVC demand excluded.
* Norway from national totals, split by Swedish category shares. Country to NUTS3 by medium and high process heat,
* 2020 = 0, linear to 2030, 2040, 2050; NUTS3 aggregated to model regions. Switzerland (not in EHB): previous
* value x fertilizer+steel/total EHB ratio of the modelled countries.
